      "created_at": "2015-08-18T16:22:52.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The team configuration makes sense and with the amount of cards they play which are damaging Ground Pound and Heroic Interception. &nbsp;</p><p>I tried a random grouping against them and survived only due to how many power uses I could give AZ once all the other heroes were down. &nbsp; I'd use Thermal Shockwave a few times and then use Coolant Blast. &nbsp; Due to the villain reshuffling AZ was often hit by fire damage there too which was great.</p><p>https://www.dropbox.com/s/qhfho9k61gtqgx7/photo%20aug%2011%2C%2011%2021%2042%20pm.png?dl=0</p>",
