      "id": 146387,
      "name": "broccoli",
      "username": "broccoli",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/broccoli/{size}/1861_2.png",
      "created_at": "2015-08-19T03:55:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>One really disgusting combo you could try is Legacy + Visionary + TL Tachyon. &nbsp;You use TL + Visionary to give Legacy the draw to find 2 Take Downs, and then you just use Mental Divergence to cycle them. &nbsp;To be fair, that works against MOST villains, but especially so against Ennead, because plays are everything to them.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Edit: Add in Argent Adept, and you could do it with just 1 Take Down. &nbsp;AA Sarabande's Take Down away, Mental Divergence puts it back on top, TL gives him the draw, he plays it on his turn. &nbsp;With Rhapsody of Vigor and Motivational Charge, you could keep that up forever.</p>",
      "post_number": 4,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:24:19.312Z",
